  "details": "There is an issue with the VRChat SDK regarding unity 2022.\n\nIt's minor, but for the low quality mirror, if I wanted to set the reflection layer to only player, I can't, because the UI is cut off, making the drop down menu only go as far as the UI selection, rather than being to see the other selection tables after it. This makes it basically impossible to use a low quality mirror for Unity 2022 in the vrchat world sdk.\n\n(this is also using the example mirror provided, and not any third part addons or extensions)",
